================ result ================
Phase 2 fallbacks: 0 on all ten runs, both architectures. The two sieves agree
at 10^10, as they do at itemF_arch_differential.log's three configurations.

Total computation time (s), five runs each, sample sd (n-1):

  sm_120 : 1.11439, 1.09352, 1.08692, 1.10563, 1.08652
           mean 1.09740, sd 0.01224
  sm_75  : 0.611155, 0.584806, 0.591888, 0.569132, 0.566784
           mean 0.58475, sd 0.01813

  ratio sm_120 / sm_75 = 1.88x

The sm_75 build is the faster of the two at this size, by 1.88x, confirming the
1.9x referred to in itemF_arch_differential.log. The cause is not established.
Fallback counts are identical, so this is code generation, not correctness. No
reported figure in this corrigendum depends on the sm_75 build.
